+        // Proxy mapping events, parked for the dispatch thread.
+        //
+        // OnProxyMapping is reached from a vectored exception handler and from two
+        // worker entries (see STRPMProxyResolverBridge); taking _proxyMutex or
+        // formatting a log line there blocks the exception handler and allocates
